id: neko-mimicry
name: Neko Mimicry
order: 2
category: mind
importance: primary
# (1) The Quick Learner Talent, given with the Trait and kept if it is lost.
grantsTalent: quick-learner
description: >
  Neko Majins can unerringly replicate the techniques of others with ease after witnessing them, often putting a spin on them to boot.
text: >
  Neko Mimicry (Mind): Neko Majins can unerringly replicate the techniques of others with ease after witnessing them, often putting a spin on them to boot.
  (1)-[Passive]: At Character Creation, gain the Quick Learner Talent.
  (2)-[Passive]: You may ignore the effects of any Disadvantage with ‘Restricted’ in its name on any Signature Technique you have gained through the effects of Quick Learner (either as Copied Techniques or those you have gained through the second effect of Quick Learner).
  (3)-[Passive]: For Copied Techniques, you may use either your Force or Magic Modifier as the Damage Attribute and ignore the Force Score prerequisite to use Energy Attacks.
  (4)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If an Opponent who is not at Long Range uses a Standard Maneuver with an Action Cost of 1 Action, you may use that Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. If the Maneuver was a Special Maneuver, you must have access to that Special Maneuver to use it.
  (5)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you use a Copied Technique possessed by a Character, apply the following effects depending on if that Character is an Ally or an Opponent:

  * Ally: That Ally may use the United Attack Maneuver without spending an Action through its effects (they must still be on an adjacent Square to you).
  * Opponent: Make a Clash (Morale) against that Opponent. If you win, they suffer from the Guard Down Combat Condition for the duration of that Attacking Maneuver.

  (6)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: When using a Copied Technique, you may apply the Multi-Profile Super Profile to that Attacking Maneuver. If you do, you must select a Profile that is used by at least 1 of your Signature Techniques.

---

[passive]
# (2) Restricted - Environment, State and Weather not kept to, on a Technique from Quick Learner - Copied, or kept for its
# TP (technique-use.mjs) - Majin See, Majin Do's (2).
allow quickLearner.ignoreRestricted;
# (3) A Copied Technique: Force or Magic Modifier as its Damage Attribute, asked; no Force Score 3 for an Energy one.
allow quickLearner.copiedAttribute;
# (4) An Opponent not at Long Range using a Standard Maneuver of 1 Action, in a Combat Encounter: that Maneuver offered on its
# card out of sequence, once a Round - a Special one only where you have access to it (chat.mjs mimicryOffers).
allow mimicry.copyManeuver;
# (5) A Copied Technique declared, whose Character is on the scene: a box among its questions, once a Round - an Ally's,
# the United Attack free of its Action for them on its card; an Opponent's, the Morale Clash with them, won, Guard Down for
# the attack (use-maneuver.mjs askTechniqueDeclaration, chat.mjs postAttack).
allow mimicry.owner;
# (6) A Copied Technique declared: Multi-Profile, its second Profile one of your own Signature Techniques', asked once an
# Encounter - its KP paid (use-maneuver.mjs mimicryMultiProfile).
allow mimicry.multiProfile;
